# Unreal-generated build state. Regenerated by UnrealBuildTool; never hand-edited,
# and large enough (Intermediate alone was 156 MB) that committing it is pointless.
Intermediate/
Binaries/
DerivedDataCache/
Saved/
.vscode/
Makefile
*.target
*.modules

# Engine art and generated content are derived; the imported/authored assets (models,
# characters, weapons, materials) ARE committed so a fresh clone builds and runs.
Content/*
!Content/HIImported/
!Content/Characters/
!Content/Weapons/
!Content/HIGenerated/
!Content/HIProbe/

# THE FOUR TREES BELOW WERE MISSING UNTIL 2026-10-24, and their absence was a live footgun
# rather than untidiness: `PackagedLinux/` was 2.9 GB, `Dist/` 959 MB, `SourceAssets/` 592 MB,
# and none of it was ignored -- so `git add -A` on this repository would have tried to push
# ~4.4 GB into a PUBLIC repo, and every `git status` listed them as untracked work. They are
# all derived: build output, a cook, packaging staging, and the un-imported sources that
# `tools/import-assets.sh` turns into the `Content/` assets that ARE committed.
Build/
Dist/
PackagedLinux/
SourceAssets/

# Verification captures. Reproducible from the harness in README.md, and large.
shots/

# Listening samples: generated audio kept out of the repo, regenerate with
# tools/make-voices-neural.sh
voice-samples/
